  { mistake: 'Underestimating the spice', fix: 'Order one dish at a time until you know your tolerance. Mala builds — dish three hits harder than dish one. Always have plain rice and a cold drink within reach.' },
  { mistake: 'Not having addresses in Chinese', fix: 'Save your hotel, key attractions, and "please take me to the airport" in Chinese characters in your phone. Show the screen to taxi drivers. This saves you 20 minutes of charades per ride.' },
